 "html": "Har fotat en del idag så här bjuds på lite sköna bilder:<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05177_151269610.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05204_151272804.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05277_151273572.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05297_151275015.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05317_151275526.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05322_151276043.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05319_151276672.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05339_151277393.jpg\"/><br/>Hahahaha jag kan inte sluta skratta åt denna bilden. Han är för söt K.<br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn2.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05373_151278238.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05416_151278701.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05424_151279239.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn1.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05445_151279938.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05496_151280306.jpg\"/><br/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/dsc05491_151280794.jpg\"/><br/>Och det var väl allt för denna gången. För er som har mig på facebook så finns det fler bilder där ;)<br/>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/cdn3.cdnme.se/cdn/7-1/2672483/images/2011/alvert-tag_146465487.jpg\"/></div>",
